        <mxCell id="c126" parent="c119" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b&gt;Colour = core type.&lt;/b&gt; Every green box &lt;i&gt;is an&lt;/i&gt; Asset and every amber box &lt;i&gt;is an&lt;/i&gt; Event, so the &quot;is a&quot; lines into the core are not drawn.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Every Event&lt;/b&gt; occurs at a Location, on a Calendar date, and is reported by a Source. Drawn once, on the core Event.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Lines:&lt;/b&gt; crow&#39;s foot = many · bar = exactly one · circle = optional.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Black&lt;/b&gt; = inside a subject area · &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b85450&quot;&gt;red dashed&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; = crosses subject areas.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Area&lt;/b&gt; = community, census tract, zoning district, flood zone or service zone. An Area can sit within a larger Area.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Infrastructure Asset&lt;/b&gt; = streetlight, sidewalk, bike lane, pipe, tree.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Facility&lt;/b&gt; = park, waste facility, depot.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sector&lt;/b&gt; classifies Parties, and Assets and Events through their types.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Party&lt;/b&gt; = organisations only in Phase 1 (no personal data)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="420" width="495" x="15" y="165" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
